      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t want anyone using this after this patch is applied. So let\u0027s rename it to something like `ununsed`. Here is an example of how to do that and retain the ABI:\n\n```\n#ifdef __GENKSYMS__\nspinlock_t dpcm_lock;\n#else\nspinlock_t unused;\n#endif\n```",
