      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just to note, if someone is using `dpcm_lock` in an external module, then it\u0027s possible this patch would be breaking their drivers. I grep\u0027d the Pixel 6 drivers and didn\u0027t find any references. IMO, I think it\u0027s better to rename the variable so that partners would fail compiling their drivers if there are references to `dpcm_lock`.",
